VALIDATION / INTERPRETATION
- Fuel is calculated separately at trip level using the urban-consumption proxy.
- Engine oil is not added separately because it is included in the maintenance plan.
- Parking is a trip-specific cost and is not included in annual ownership costs.
- RCA is a generic national baseline, not a personal insurance quotation.
- Residual value, amortisation rate, tyre cost and repair contingency are explicit model assumptions.
